5,139 likes, 82 comments - beautifuldestinations on October 12, 2026: "12 weeks can change a lot… 

When the Beautiful Destinations Academy started, our creators came from all different backgrounds and at different stages of their work. Over the 12 weeks, they had the chance to shoot in new environments, try completely different approaches and figure out the kind of stories they actually wanted to tell. 

A big part of the experience was simply working alongside each other. Everyone brought something different to the group, and seeing how each person approached the same places and experiences made this cohort so special. It’s been incredible seeing the difference between the work they created at the beginning and where they ended up by the end of those 12 weeks. 

Want to be part of the next Academy? Applications for 2027 open soon. Keep an eye here for details!

